sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AT as ActivityThread
    participant CI as ContextImpl
    participant Ap as Application
    AT->>AT: handleBindApplication（fork 后报到）
    AT->>AT: LoadedApk.getPackageInfoNoCheck
    AT->>CI: createAppContext（进程级 AppContext）
    AT->>Ap: LoadedApk.makeApplication：new Application
    Ap->>Ap: attach(base = ContextImpl)
    AT->>Ap: installContentProviders（provider 先于 onCreate！）
    AT->>Ap: callApplicationOnCreate
